		{ key = "button:Update", text = [[
### button:Update(changes: table): DiscordButton
Updates the button in the existing Discord response.

```lua
local button = discord.button({
    Label = "Loading...",
    Style = "Primary",
})

button:Update({
    Label = "Finished",
    Style = "Success",
})
```

Accepted update fields:

```lua
button:Update({
    Label = "New label",
    Style = "Secondary",
    Disabled = true,
    OwnerOnly = false,
})
```

Returns the same button object, so chaining is possible:

```lua
button:Update({
    Label = "Done",
    Disabled = true,
}):Destroy()
```

